sequenceDiagram
    participant RT as Render thread
    participant AC as kms_atomic_commit
    participant DRM as KMS driver
    participant PT as presentation_tracker

    RT->>AC: commit(request + kms_damage_region)
    AC->>DRM: atomic commit + damage blob
    DRM-->>AC: page_flip_event
    AC->>PT: on_page_flip(event)
    PT->>PT: on_feedback(kms_damage, hw_clock)
